WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.170
Two explorers find a clearing
full of flowers and weeds.

2
00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:06.400
One says a gardener tends it.

3
00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:08.110
The other says no.

4
00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:11.800
They put up an electric fence
and patrol with bloodhounds.

5
00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:14.180
No gardener ever appears.

6
00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:18.600
So the believer says the gardener
is invisible and intangible.

7
00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:23.510
If nothing could ever change your
mind, are you really claiming anything?

8
00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:27.190
In this mission, you'll meet a
famous debate from the 1950s,

9
00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:30.120
and the parables its three thinkers told.

10
00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:34.440
Then you'll meet a student sure the
university's dons want to murder him,

11
00:00:34.490 --> 00:00:37.850
and a resistance fighter
who trusts a stranger.

12
00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:43.310
Your mission: weigh up whether a belief
that nothing can shake still says anything.
